    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTSIDERS</strong> is a third-person shooter blending survival horror with intense cooperative gameplay, designed <strong>exclusively for two players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on a remote island shrouded in mystery, you and a friend embark on a journey to uncover its dark secrets while confronting disturbing enemies and relentless challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast map with diverse landscapes, ranging from dense forests and abandoned ruins to underground caves and decaying villages. Each location offers a unique atmosphere filled with hidden dangers and puzzles that test your skills and teamwork.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich and Immersive World</strong><br>Discover a living island full of interconnected areas, stories to unravel, and secrets to uncover.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique and Innovative Enemies</strong><br>Face creatures that break genre conventions, each with distinctive behaviors and traits that force you to adapt your strategies constantly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Cooperative Gameplay</strong> <br>Leverage the complementary abilities of two protagonists:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Her</strong>: A skilled sharpshooter with precise aim but vulnerable in close combat. She can pass through tight spaces and is faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Him</strong>: Strong and agile in melee combat, excelling at heavy blows but less effective with firearms. He cannot fit through tight spaces but can push or lift heavy objects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/c02931ce7cb485e5fbf68dd1930a32a6.poster.avif?t=1734570745\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/c02931ce7cb485e5fbf68dd1930a32a6.webm?t=1734570745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/c02931ce7cb485e5fbf68dd1930a32a6.mp4?t=1734570745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Environments</strong><br>Immersive sound design and detailed visuals create constant tension, with scares and dangers keeping you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/6e9a43332413b50acd28ee7ad92fc7e9.poster.avif?t=1734570745\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/6e9a43332413b50acd28ee7ad92fc7e9.webm?t=1734570745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/6e9a43332413b50acd28ee7ad92fc7e9.mp4?t=1734570745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles</strong><br>Solve creative and challenging puzzles to progress, often requiring perfect coordination with your partner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/8020efb5876db88cee392e237aaf229f.poster.avif?t=1734570745\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/8020efb5876db88cee392e237aaf229f.webm?t=1734570745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/8020efb5876db88cee392e237aaf229f.mp4?t=1734570745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>OUTSIDERS</strong>, every step is a choice, and every discovery brings you closer to a truth more terrifying than any enemy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTSIDERS</strong> is a third-person shooter blending survival horror with intense cooperative gameplay, designed <strong>exclusively for two players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on a remote island shrouded in mystery, you and a friend embark on a journey to uncover its dark secrets while confronting disturbing enemies and relentless challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast map with diverse landscapes, ranging from dense forests and abandoned ruins to underground caves and decaying villages. Each location offers a unique atmosphere filled with hidden dangers and puzzles that test your skills and teamwork.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich and Immersive World</strong><br>Discover a living island full of interconnected areas, stories to unravel, and secrets to uncover.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique and Innovative Enemies</strong><br>Face creatures that break genre conventions, each with distinctive behaviors and traits that force you to adapt your strategies constantly.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Cooperative Gameplay</strong> <br>Leverage the complementary abilities of two protagonists:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Her</strong>: A skilled sharpshooter with precise aim but vulnerable in close combat. She can pass through tight spaces and is faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Him</strong>: Strong and agile in melee combat, excelling at heavy blows but less effective with firearms. He cannot fit through tight spaces but can push or lift heavy objects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extra