s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368910/extras/8020efb5876db88cee392e237aaf229f.mp4?t=1734570745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>OUTSIDERS</strong>, every step is a choice, and every discovery brings you closer to a truth more terrifying than any enemy.</p>",
